          "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n  \"shop_id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa7\",\n  \"method_payment\": \"Nequi\",\n  \"delivery_fee\": 5000,\n  \"address\": {\n    \"address\": \"Calle 123 # 45-67\",\n    \"latitude\": 4.609710,\n    \"longitude\": -74.081750\n  },\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"item_id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa8\",\n      \"amount\": 2,\n      \"observation\": \"Sin cebolla\",\n      \"flavors\": {\n        \"Hawaiana\": 1,\n        \"Pepperoni\": 1\n      },\n      \"additions\": [\n        {\n          \"addition_id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa9\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["orders"]
        },
        "description": "Crea una nueva orden. `customer_id` se obtiene automáticamente del token. `method_payment` acepta: Nequi, Efectivo. Requiere cookie `encargalo-session`. Roles: Customer, customer."
